--
^warning: ignoring
--
The ref-qualifier was neither in function_identifier (`k() &' and `k() &&'
shared one symbol) nor in function_template_signatures_equivalent (the `&&'
template was unified with the `&' one), and fargs.match /
member_template_object_viable never checked it.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
